    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051206.0287\n\nLJUBLJANA, Dec 6 , 2005\n\nOSCE fails to agree joint declaration\n\n\n\n\nThe 55 member states of the OSCE failed Tuesday to agree a joint declaration at a ministerial meeting here, instead issuing a statement by the current holder of its rotating presidency, Slovenia.\n\nThe statement was issued by the conference chairman, Slovenian Foreign Minister Dimitrij Rupel.\n\nThe move followed Russia's refusal to acknowledge a 1999 commitment to withdraw troops from Georgia and Moldova.",
